      "Search supported Harness Memory and Serena memory systems when available.",
      "Promote selected observations into project decision and pattern records.",
      "Merge existing Plans.md tasks into a structured replacement while preserving task categories.",
      "Guide an interactive migration of AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, and Plans.md with backups."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "It only searches memory systems that are installed and available to the current environment.",
